B.a__=new A.h0("This one is closed. If it comes back, write a new message and it will arrive with everything about your account attached again.",null)
B.a_0=new A.h0("If this is about somebody's safety and it is more than you should be handling alone, tell FCL \u2014 Profile > Talk to FCL. Closing it here does not send it on.",null)
B.a_1=new A.h0("The end date starts the clock. Results are public for a year afterwards; then only the winner stays public and the full record belongs to the people who were there.",null)
B.a_2=new A.h0("This removes them and sends a report to FCL staff. Unlike an ordinary removal, it counts toward a review of their account \u2014 three reported removals, from three different leagues and three different admins, and the account is suspended pending a look by a person.",null)
B.a_3=new A.h0("Codes get replaced when a league retires an old one, and every link made with the old code stops working at that moment. That is deliberate \u2014 it is what makes a leaked invitation recoverable.",null)
B.a_4=new A.h0("The start date also sets the refund deadlines: full refund until a week before, a tournament credit until the day before, and nothing inside twenty-four hours.",null)
B.a_5=new A.h0("These results are on the world ladder. They were validated at a sanctioned event, which is what the mark on them means.",null)
B.a_6=new A.h0("If your account is suspended and you want to tell us your side, use the box on your profile instead \xc3\xa2\xe2\u201a\xac\xe2\u20ac\x9d that one reaches the person reviewing it, with the reports it answers in front of them. This inbox is for everything else.",null)
